    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113950" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθιζ-ῐνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθιζός</span>
			, twice restored metri gr. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθεσινός</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i> (both lyr.), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τὸν χ. ἄνθρωπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>V.</u>
					281
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σκόροδον τὸ χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ra.</u>
					987
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.88
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.61
			</span></i>.</div>
